  "notes": "{強|つよ}まる means to become stronger or intensify. It describes a natural increase in strength or intensity.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{強|つよ}める→強める：02296_tsuyomeru⟧ (transitive - to strengthen something)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{強|つよ}まる: the wind strengthens\n- ⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{強|つよ}まる: the rain intensifies\n- ⟦{批判|ひはん}→批判：03580_hihan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{強|つよ}まる: criticism grows\n- ⟦{信頼|しんらい}→信頼：03268_shinrai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{強|つよ}まる: trust deepens\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{強|つよ}まっている indicates an ongoing or resulting state of being strengthened.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{強|つよ}める→強める：02296_tsuyomeru⟧: to strengthen (transitive)\n- ⟦{強|つよ}く→強い：00820_tsuyoi⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to become strong (similar meaning)\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}まる→弱まる：02330_yowamaru⟧: to weaken (opposite)",
